     The action key (enter, emoji) and the action row of long-press panels:
     a filled key. Its icons are white in both themes, so the fill is primary
     T40 (T20 pressed). 38 dp is the stock drawable's size: the keyboard keeps
     this key square from it.
-->
<shape xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:shape="rectangle">
    <size android:width="38dp" android:height="38dp" />
    <corners android:radius="8dp" />
    <solid android:color="@android:color/system_primary_light" />
</shape>
